# docs/research/INTERVIEWS-PHASE0/RAW/

This directory holds raw interview artefacts:

- Audio/video recordings (.mov, .mp4, .webm)
- Verbatim transcripts (.txt, .md)
- Pseudonym → real-name mapping (MAPPING.txt)
- Signed consent replies (consent.txt)

**Everything here is gitignored.** Only this `.gitkeep` file is committed — so the directory structure is documented, but no personal data ever leaves the founder's laptop.

Retention: 90 days from interview date, then deletion per
`../CONSENT-FORM.md`.

Encryption at rest: macOS FileVault / Windows BitLocker / Linux LUKS — always on.

See [../CONSENT-FORM.md](../CONSENT-FORM.md) and [../INTERVIEW-GUIDE.md](../INTERVIEW-GUIDE.md).
